WEBVTT

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:09.230
Is that all you've got? You guys can do better than that!

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.950
We can't lose today! Cheer louder!

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:19.240
Set-pieces. This is where we need to be focusing really hard!

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:22.790
It's into the box!

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.080
Mine!

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.800
How can we concede at this kind of time? Dammit!

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.140
I screwed up.

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:39.180
I was supposed to mark him!

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:41.060
Ishihama!

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:45.100
Don't let your head down! We're only starting!

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:49.440
That was due to a set play, not a breakdown in our defense!

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:52.110
Come on, walk with your heads held high!

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:52.440
Yes!
Come on, walk with your heads held high!

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:55.070
Alright! That's the way!

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.950
You've become a capable team!

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:45.520
What kind of a performance is that?!

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:49.350
Do you guys know how much we've paid to come to Sapporo to cheer for you?

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:53.480
Don't you guys dare shame Tatsumi! You bunch of flops!

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:56.690
That's not nice, Shige.

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:59.240
It's alright. What's there to fear?

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:00.320
Hey.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:04.120
Were you the one whining just now?

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.660
The players are giving it their all!

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.540
What rubbish were you guys saying, assholes?!

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:13.080
What's with you then? Being full of yourselves...

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:15.500
Is it wrong to speak my mind?

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.550
What are you guys doing?

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:21.380
Is this the time to be fighting amongst ourselves?

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:30.520
I'll be informing this matter to our leader, understand?

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:33.520
What's with that cocky face of yours?

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.400
We were fans of ETU way before you!

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.530
Calm down, Shige!

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.570
You guys can cheer louder than that!

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:48.540
We can't lose today! Together with the Cup game, we've already lost four in a row!

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:54.080
We need to break that duck by beating Sapparo, and then crush Fuwa's Nagoya in the next match!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:56.340
You there! Cheer louder!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.880
Use your diaphragm! Get your hands up!

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:04.340
Show them our power! We will do all we can to end our losing streak!

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:12.810
Does our way of supporting look dumb to them?

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:17.150
That's a great winning goal, Tatsumi!

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.360
Gotou, your defense is-

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.490
Don't do that, Shige!

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:24.610
You played well, Gotou!

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:29.660
Let's wish ETU all the best in winning the league!

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:34.120
Soccer is supposed to be fun.

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:37.000
Tatsumi taught us that.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:41.340
Back then, the players and fans were all very supportive of each other.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.010
But what has it come to now?

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:51.060
Having a hooligan to lead a bunch of people.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.560
In the end, we still can't win!

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:56.650
They are definitely not genuine ETU fans.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.570
Now that Tatsumi's back,

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:03.570
Should we get our original fans back and restore the atmosphere of our glory days?

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.740
Is this to be our five straight loss?

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:17.880
Ever since I've started a match, our team hasn't been winning!

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.430
Am I the reason... why the team lost?

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:33.310
Ok then, now for our next match!

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:38.440
Let's forget about today and get ready for the match against Nagoya, everyone.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.690
Y-Yes!

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:50.580
You guys...

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:54.790
Assemble outside gate W-1 in ten minutes!

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:59.630
Javelin Iwata, Sun Arrow Hiroshima,

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:05.420
The two matches against Shimizu Impulse, and in addition, today's defeat to FC Sapporo,

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:08.970
Dammit! That's five losses! Five straight losses!

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:13.560
When are we going to get our first win?!

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:21.020
I'm not dwelling about relegation prospects, but FC Sapporo are a team that just got promoted this season!

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:24.280
We should have been able to win this one comfortably!

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:26.440
You should relax and calm down!

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:31.990
We should exercise patience, vice-chairman. Tatsumi will surely win the upcoming match.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:38.000
Do you understand the position you're in?

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:43.000
You ignored the supporters' objection to bring Tatsumi over.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:46.460
If Tatsumi were to get fired, you're going to be booted off as well!

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:52.640
You better get yourself prepared for that. Understood, General Manager Gotou?

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:59.770
You're only a vice-chairman, do you even know what trash you're vomiting?! I am the chairman!

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:03.860
Don't you dare mention things like sacking Gotou!

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.280
Shut it, you! You're a part of this too!

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:08.860
What did you say?! You asshole!

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:11.110
Bad news! The fans...

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:26.380
Please give way! The bus can't leave like this. The players are tired!

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:30.630
No can do. We'll only do so if you get Tatsumi down here.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:33.890
We would like to have a word with Tatsumi.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:40.060
How can I get the manager down when you guys are crowding up the place? Do you guys realize what you are doing?

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:41.940
Of course we do.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:46.980
We planned this before coming here. How about you guys?

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.820
Do you people ever played with hearts on your sleeves?

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:51.450
What?

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:54.620
We have a lot to chat with Tatsumi.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:58.790
Team's formation... Game instructions...

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:04.580
Not just that, we've already had ten years worth of hatred bottled all up.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.590
That's right! Get down here!

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.210
Get you ass down here, Tatsumi!

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:09.630
Don't screw with us!

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:11.720
What are you doing to our ETU?!

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:14.220
Get the hell down here, Tatsumi! Don't be a coward!

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:17.680
They're scary.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:20.220
I don't even dare to look at them in the eyes.

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:30.320
Manager, do you need me to take care of them?

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:33.280
I should be able to...

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:34.450
Let me ask...

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:37.830
Am I the one they wanna have a word with?

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.620
You get down here, Tatsumi!

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.500
We know you're up there!

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.750
So they are calling me.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.460
Alright then, I'll just have to go see them.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.630
Wait, if you go down there...

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:54.930
I wouldn't want you to get involved.

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.390
Dealing with the fans is also part of my job.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:02.600
You guys just need to concentrate on football.

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:04.810
Got it?

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.030
Get back to your seat, Tatsumi.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:22.120
As I expected, with your character, you'll definitely do it.

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.500
Glad I've made it.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:29.210
Do you know, Gotou... I am the one they want.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:30.960
That's why it has to be me.

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.050
I can't let you out.

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:38.800
I will do it. I will convince them, even if I have to do it all night! This is my job.

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:42.810
What happened, Tatsumi?

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:55.190
Well, if you insist. I'm counting on you.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:59.320
Just don't infuriate them even more and get roughed up, Gotou.

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:09.920
What's this, Gotou?! It's Tatsumi that we want to talk to!

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:11.420
I'll handle things here.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:12.460
Tatsumi,

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:13.170
Quick, get in the bus!

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:15.550
You must've had it tough as a manager.
Quick, get in the bus!

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.590
Your battle is not only on the pitch.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:23.970
Everywhere that you go, it's a constant battle.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.230
Please calm down.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:32.360
Being a manager is lonely.

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.440
But Tatsumi...

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:37.110
I'll be on your side always.

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:41.120
I understand your feelings... But I want you to believe in me!

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:42.410
I will...

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:45.240
...trust you with all my heart.

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:57.670
The match has gone into the 2nd half, and Nagoya has taken the initiative...

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:03.140
Carlos dribbles down field, passes it to Zelberto, he continues on...

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.730
And Pepe finishes it nicely to go two up!

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:10.350
Wing back, Carlos.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:12.350
Attacking midfielder, Zelberto.

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.610
And striker, Pepe.

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:21.410
Nagoya's Holy Trinity from Brazil has been key to their performance in which they have won all their matches thus far.

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:25.280
Which team will be able to stop their red, hot form?

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:31.420
Their next opponent will be Manager Fuwa's former club, East Tokyo United.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:34.880
Up next, the highlights of Kawasaki vs Kobe.

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:40.010
That cocky smile of his...

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:44.850
A Brazilian international and two players of Japanese international standard.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:49.520
These are the kind of players he intended to bid a high price for during his time here.

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:55.770
His plans failed in the end and he blamed it on the higher management. He finally got what he wished now.

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:57.570
That bastard.

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:01.110
He's not going to be smirking for long, bro.

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:03.570
He's not going to win every single game.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:07.910
Though I'd love to say that in his face.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:11.500
Our team has been the opposite, with our manager that way.

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:13.460
It'll be alright, vice-chairman.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:17.590
The players should have understood Tatsumi's intentions by now.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:22.470
As they start to know each other more, Tatsumi will do better.

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:27.720
You should take a break today, Gotou.

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:33.020
Didn't you have a hard time with the fans yesterday? You'll get sick.

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:33.810
I'm fine.

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:36.610
Futhermore, I shouldn't be taking a break alone.

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:39.480
Tatsumi's doing his best.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.860
We'll just have to win then.

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:44.990
Win, I say!

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:00.460
I can't do it! I'll stutter!

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:02.300
What're you doing, Tsubaki?

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:09.510
N-Nothing! I just happened to walk past! It's true!

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:18.860
Why use someone like me?

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:23.070
I'm always making mistakes, infuriating others...

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:25.400
Why is the manager still starting me?

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:33.370
You're still racking your brains about these things?

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:37.000
Tsubaki,

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:42.880
You're thinking that you're the reason as to why we lost all these games, right?

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:45.670
Oh no, that's not it.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:50.350
It's just that the manager put me out there, yet I couldn't contribute anything for the team.

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:55.480
I'm trying to figure out what a player like me can accomplish.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.900
Trying to play for the team?

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:03.190
Yes. I-

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:06.110
I play for my own sake, though.

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:09.820
Though the manager nominated me as captain,

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:14.500
I have no time to worry about the rest.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:20.170
I'm too busy exploring for my own possibilities on the pitch.

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.960
That is why I have no advise for you.

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:29.840
This also shows that I am no different from you.

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:34.600
I'm sorry.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:36.350
I'll be going.

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:38.350
However, Tsubaki,

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:44.360
Matches against the two top teams are special.

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:50.450
A player like you would need long practice hours to get used to them; that's no surprise.

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:54.080
Even a rookie manager would know that.

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:58.080
Or you would've been benched a long time ago.

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:01.960
You should accumulate as much experience in order to improve yourself.

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:05.710
Stop thinking about useless stuff.

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:11.340
Doing this, you should be able to see things that were previously oblivious to you.

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:15.430
Yes. Thank you very much.

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:22.270
Murakoshi is also doing his best.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.860
I too, have to do my best and give it my all!

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:29.780
Don't run along the corridor!

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:32.990
My apologies, Miss Nagata.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:34.780
Goodness.

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:38.790
You're always so full of energy. You should save it for a match.

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:41.540
Yes.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:48.880
I've been watching ETU since I was a kid, and I've never seen a player who could run like you.

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.630
You're like a dog!

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:55.470
The Prince occasionally does say the truth. A little puppy.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:02.520
I look forward to your performance, Tsubaki.

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:07.610
Yes.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:25.920
Just wait and see, Nagoya! I'm going to smash you to bits!

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:31.920
But before that, I should get some sleep.

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:48.730
Even the media has started to speculate the sacking.

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:53.110
We have no other choice. It doesn't seem to be getting better.

00:16:56.490 --> 00:17:01.370
Common reporters like us can't write anything negative. If this goes on though, we'll...

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.380
She's here again.

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:09.380
Good morning.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:11.260
Work hard!

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:12.380
Yo!

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:20.100
A freelance reporter, yet she still came all the way out here to catch a game. She certainly has the money.

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:22.100
She must be rich.

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:25.270
Did you guys read Fujisawa's reports?

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:28.480
They were published?

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:33.150
Though it's only a small column, it's a disaster.

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:37.660
To be honest, her standard is that of your average high school student.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:43.410
Those guys were talking behind my back just then...

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:48.540
Well, it's only normal to receive criticism after writing that article.

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:52.590
If they are not going to win today, I'll really be a laughing stock.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:56.050
I will also be getting the short end of the stick.

00:17:57.180 --> 00:18:00.550
Tatsumi Takeshi. I'll curse you for life if you lose.

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:02.680
Hey, Mr Kudo!

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:03.720
Yo.

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:11.440
"It's still early for Tatsumi's dismissal. ETU will soon realise their full potential..."

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:19.240
"Because after every game, I took notice of Tatsumi's increasingly confident expression."

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:28.580
Fujisawa Katsura... A guy? Or is it a girl?

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:43.100
ETU.

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:50.020
They were one of the teams I looked forward to, but their results have been dismal this season.

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:56.110
They took a gamble in choosing their manager, but it's the end, Chairman Nagata.

00:18:57.070 --> 00:19:02.570
I will make you regret your decision with my playing style.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:05.740
I am not simply throwing away money.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:10.080
By signing these three highly capable players,

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:14.130
The local players who play with them will also do so at a higher standard.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:19.840
This will, in turn, raise the overall standard of the team.

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:25.680
For this, I've selected these three Brazilians amongst hundreds of them.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:26.640
That's weird.

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:27.930
What?

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:30.640
They're gone! They're not even doing their warm-ups!

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:35.480
That's strange. They were here a while ago.

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:36.110
For goodness sake!

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:39.990
Deploy all men to search for them! The match's about to start!

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:41.110
Yes!

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:47.120
Dammit! The only flaw about this is their lax attitude.

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:55.670
Pepe! Now's not the time to eat!

00:19:56.340 --> 00:20:00.260
The match's about to start! What if you get an upset stomach?

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:04.220
Pepe, are you listening?!

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.680
Zelberto!

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:10.640
Look, it's my shirt!

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:14.060
That's <i>great</i> to know, Carlos.

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:16.610
I'm going to send it home to my family!

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:19.940
You're going to buy it?

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:24.450
Pepe, do you want to buy one too?

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:26.580
Then...

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.830
I'll buy some too then.

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:31.580
Are the three of them...

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:32.910
That's right.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:35.750
They're not playing today?

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:39.710
Pepe, there's no need to buy so many!

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:43.970
Excuse me...

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:45.340
Oh, foreigners!

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:47.850
Ok, ok!

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.570
Amazing!

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:05.030
We should return them the ball.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:16.330
Are they gods?

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:24.630
Pass it, Pepe!

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:42.280
That was close.

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:45.360
Or things would have gone bad, otherwise.

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:48.530
Didn't I tell you to keep an eye on them?

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:49.120
My apologies. But I did warn them .

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:51.740
Carlos, isn't this the replica jersey you bought?

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:54.540
Change it now!

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:59.380
Anyway, I want the three of them to be concentrating when they are playing!

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:01.920
That is what I brought you to Japan for!

00:22:03.260 --> 00:22:04.630
Do you understand?

00:22:07.930 --> 00:22:09.680
Ok, boss.

00:22:12.970 --> 00:22:14.270
Don't screw with me!

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:17.440
How could I lose to someone like him?

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:20.690
The team's ace....

00:22:21.980 --> 00:22:22.690
...is me!

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:41.080
Because of Tatsumi's confident expression, ETU's season will officially start now, eh?

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:49.340
We live in an fascinating world. There's actually someone who shares the same sentiments as me.

00:24:15.550 --> 00:24:17.060
Let's hit the ground running!

00:24:17.640 --> 00:24:18.260
Let's go!

00:24:18.470 --> 00:24:19.310
Yeah!

00:24:19.470 --> 00:24:21.640
We need to rock up this place!

00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:24.520
They will only show their ruthlessness for a brief moment.

00:24:24.730 --> 00:24:26.650
You're not even worth my effort, Itagaki!
